{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphaseAlgebraic","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphaseAlgebraic","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphaseExclusion"],"declarations":9,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.no_braid_algebraic_D","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.no_braid_algebraic_D","kind":"theorem","line":263,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/BraidImageEigenphaseAlgebraic.lean#L263-L274","doc":"**Branch 1 is closed for convention D — the canonical one — algebraic case\nincluded.**  `cos` is even, so the negated phase carries the argument. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.no_braid_algebraic_C","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.no_braid_algebraic_C","kind":"theorem","line":254,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/BraidImageEigenphaseAlgebraic.lean#L254-L261","doc":"**Branch 1 is closed for convention C, algebraic case included.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.no_laurent_of_algebraic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.no_laurent_of_algebraic","kind":"theorem","line":227,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/BraidImageEigenphaseAlgebraic.lean#L227-L250","doc":"**Subsumption, verified.**  `no_laurent_of_surjective_nonpos` re-derived as\nthe `d = 1` case of `coeffs_zero_of_surjective_nonpos`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.coeffs_zero_of_surjective_nonpos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.coeffs_zero_of_surjective_nonpos","kind":"theorem","line":149,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/BraidImageEigenphaseAlgebraic.lean#L149-L217","doc":"**No non-trivial algebraic relation.**  If `2 cos (α ·)` satisfies a\npolynomial relation over `ℝ[X]` on `[1,∞)`, and `α` attains every non-positive\nreal there, then every coefficient polynomial vanishes.\n\nThis strengthens `no_laurent_of_surjective_nonpos` from Laurent relations to\nalgebraic ones; see the module docstring. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.sliceY_coeff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.sliceY_coeff","kind":"theorem","line":140,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/BraidImageEigenphaseAlgebraic.lean#L140-L145","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.sliceY_eval","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.sliceY_eval","kind":"theorem","line":136,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/BraidImageEigenphaseAlgebraic.lean#L136-L138","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.sliceY","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.sliceY","kind":"def","line":132,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/BraidImageEigenphaseAlgebraic.lean#L132-L134","doc":"`S_x(Y) = ∑_{j ≤ d} p_j(x) · Y^j`, the relation with `X` frozen at `x`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.sliceX_eval","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.sliceX_eval","kind":"theorem","line":128,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/BraidImageEigenphaseAlgebraic.lean#L128-L130","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.sliceX","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.BraidImageEigenphase.sliceX","kind":"def","line":124,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/BraidImageEigenphaseAlgebraic.lean#L124-L126","doc":"`R_c(X) = ∑_{j ≤ d} p_j(X) · c^j`, the relation with `Y` frozen at `c`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}